---
// JsonSchemaValidatorTool — validate JSON / YAML / JSON Lines data against a JSON Schema
// (draft-04, -06, -07, 2019-09, 2020-12) with Ajv 8 in the browser. The draft comes from
// $schema unless the menu forces one; no $schema means 2020-12 (as Python jsonschema and Go
// santhosh-tekuri/jsonschema). Errors are grouped by data location and linked to the line in
// the data and the keyword in the schema; failed oneOf / anyOf branches are folded under the
// summary. External $ref targets are never fetched. Only the draft menu and the format switch
// are saved (ztPersist 'preference'); schema and data are not stored or sent.
